---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Temp Easy - Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy policy for Temp Easy - Body Temperature Tracker iOS app."
  ogUrl="https://idlefusion.com/temp-easy/privacy"
>
  <main>
    <section class="section-padding">
      <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="text-sm text-[var(--text-secondary)] mb-12">Temp Easy - Body Temperature Tracker &middot; Effective February 17, 2026</p>

        <div class="space-y-8 text-[var(--text-secondary)] leading-relaxed">
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">The Short Version</h2>
            <p>Temp Easy does not collect, store, or transmit any personal data. Your family's temperature readings and health information never leave your device.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">Data Storage</h2>
            <p>All temperature readings, family profiles, symptom logs, medication records, and settings are stored locally on your device using SwiftData. No data is sent to any server, cloud service, or third party. There are no user accounts and no sign-up required.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">HealthKit Integration</h2>
            <p>Temp Easy optionally integrates with Apple HealthKit to read and write body temperature data. This integration is:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc list-inside mt-2 space-y-1 ml-4">
              <li>Entirely optional — you can use the app without HealthKit</li>
              <li>Controlled by you through iOS permissions</li>
              <li>Processed locally on your device</li>
              <li>Never sent to our servers or any third party</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="mt-2">When enabled, Temp Easy can read existing body temperature data from Apple Health and write new temperature readings to Apple Health for use with other health apps.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">Analytics & Tracking</h2>
            <p>Temp Easy contains no analytics frameworks, no ad SDKs, no tracking pixels, and no telemetry of any kind. We do not use any third-party services that collect data.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">Network Usage</h2>
            <p>Temp Easy makes no network requests. The app works entirely offline. The only network activity associated with the app is through the App Store for updates.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">Notifications</h2>
            <p>Temp Easy uses local notifications to remind you to check temperatures or take medications. These notifications are scheduled entirely on your device and do not involve any external servers or push notification services.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">Export Features</h2>
            <p>Temp Easy allows you to export your data as CSV or text files for sharing with healthcare providers. These exports are generated locally on your device and shared only through the standard iOS sharing system that you control. We never receive or have access to these exported files.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">Children's Privacy</h2>
            <p>Temp Easy is designed for family use and may be used to track children's temperatures. We do not knowingly collect any information from anyone, including children under the age of 13. All data is stored locally on the parent or guardian's device.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">Changes to This Policy</h2>
            <p>If this policy changes, we will update this page with the new effective date. Since Temp Easy collects no data, meaningful changes are unlikely.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">Contact</h2>
            <p>Questions about this policy? Email us at <a href="mailto:support@idlefusion.com" class="text-[var(--accent-primary)] hover:underline">support@idlefusion.com</a>.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
